:: Mansion Housework Assess
<<effects>>

<<avery_housework_check>>

<<avery_mansion_description all>>

It will take _avery_mansion_time minutes in total to clean everything. Housekeeping skill will speed up indoor work. Tending skill will speed up garden work.
<br><br>

<<link [[Clean|Mansion Housework]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Don't clean|$avery_passage]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Mansion Housework
<<effects>>

<<set _housekeeping_time to 10 - $housekeeping / 200>>
<<set _tending_time to 10 - $tending / 200>>
<<avery_housework_check>>
<<for _i to 0; _i lt _avery_housework_count_type; _i++>>
	<<cleareventpool>>
	<<avery_mansion>>
	<<if $avery_mansion.lounge gte 1>>
		<<addinlineevent "avery_mansion_lounge">>
			<<if $avery_mansion.lounge gte 4>><<avery_housework_change "lounge" -1>>
				You right the upturned furniture in the lounge, and affix the curtains above the windows.
				<<pass _housekeeping_time>>
				<<if $avery_mansion.schedule is "lounge">><<set _event_lounge to true>><<set _event_possible to true>><</if>>
				<<if $avery_mansion.schedule is "drink">><<set _event_lounge to true>><<set _event_possible to true>><</if>>
				<br>
			<<elseif $avery_mansion.lounge is 3>><<avery_housework_change "lounge" -1>>
				You clean the television in the lounge with a cloth.
				<<pass _housekeeping_time>>
				<<if $avery_mansion.schedule is "lounge">><<set _event_lounge to true>><<set _event_possible to true>><</if>>
				<<if $avery_mansion.schedule is "drink">><<set _event_lounge to true>><<set _event_possible to true>><</if>>
				<br>
			<<elseif $avery_mansion.lounge is 2>><<avery_housework_change "lounge" -1>>
				You sweep the litter on the table in the lounge into a bin bag, then clean the table of crumbs with a dustpan and brush.
				<<pass _housekeeping_time>>
				<<if $avery_mansion.schedule is "lounge">><<set _event_lounge to true>><<set _event_possible to true>><</if>>
				<<if $avery_mansion.schedule is "drink">><<set _event_lounge to true>><<set _event_possible to true>><</if>>
				<br>
			<<elseif $avery_mansion.lounge is 1>><<avery_housework_change "lounge" -1>>
				You arrange the cushions in the lounge into a more pleasing form.
				<<pass _housekeeping_time>>
				<<if $avery_mansion.schedule is "lounge">><<set _event_lounge to true>><<set _event_possible to true>><</if>>
				<<if $avery_mansion.schedule is "drink">><<set _event_lounge to true>><<set _event_possible to true>><</if>>
				<br>
			<</if>>
		<</addinlineevent>>
	<</if>>

	<<if $avery_mansion.kitchen gte 1>>
		<<addinlineevent "avery_mansion_kitchen">>
			<<if $avery_mansion.kitchen gte 4>><<avery_housework_change "kitchen" -1>>
				You clean the kitchen sink with heavy duty chemicals.
				<<pass _housekeeping_time>>
				<br>
			<<elseif $avery_mansion.kitchen is 3>><<avery_housework_change "kitchen" -1>>
				You mop up the spillage on the kitchen floor.
				<<pass _housekeeping_time>>
				<br>
			<<elseif $avery_mansion.kitchen is 2>><<avery_housework_change "kitchen" -1>>
				You wash the dishes in the kitchen.
				<<pass _housekeeping_time>>
				<br>
			<<elseif $avery_mansion.kitchen is 1>><<avery_housework_change "kitchen" -1>>
				You clean the kitchen counters of crumbs, until they're spotless.
				<<pass _housekeeping_time>>
				<br>
			<</if>>
		<</addinlineevent>>
	<</if>>

	<<if $avery_mansion.dining gte 1>>
		<<addinlineevent "avery_mansion_dining">>
			<<if $avery_mansion.dining gte 4>><<avery_housework_change "dining" -1>>
				The dining room is a mess, but you don a pair of gloves and clean the worst of it.
				<<pass _housekeeping_time>>
				<<if $avery_mansion.schedule is "breakfast">><<set _event_dining to true>><<set _event_possible to true>><</if>>
				<br>
			<<elseif $avery_mansion.dining gte 3>><<avery_housework_change "dining" -1>>
				You fill a bucket with hot water, and scrub out the red stain in the dining room.
				<<pass _housekeeping_time>>
				<<if $avery_mansion.schedule is "breakfast">><<set _event_dining to true>><<set _event_possible to true>><</if>>
				<br>
			<<elseif $avery_mansion.dining gte 2>><<avery_housework_change "dining" -1>>
				You sweep the mess on the dining room table into a bin bag, and wipe up the stains left behind.
				<<pass _housekeeping_time>>
				<<if $avery_mansion.schedule is "breakfast">><<set _event_dining to true>><<set _event_possible to true>><</if>>
				<br>
			<<elseif $avery_mansion.dining gte 1>><<avery_housework_change "dining" -1>>
				You arrange the cutlery in the dining room, until it's fit for royalty.
				<<pass _housekeeping_time>>
				<<if $avery_mansion.schedule is "breakfast">><<set _event_dining to true>><<set _event_possible to true>><</if>>
				<br>
			<</if>>
		<</addinlineevent>>
	<</if>>

	<<if $avery_mansion.display gte 1>>
		<<addinlineevent "avery_mansion_display">>
			<<if $avery_mansion.display gte 4>><<avery_housework_change "display" -1>>
				You clear the cobwebs filling the display room, making it look less antique than the possessions kept within.
				<<pass _housekeeping_time>>
				<<if $avery_antiques.progress is 0>>
					<<set _event_display to true>><<set _event_possible to true>>
				<<elseif $avery_mansion.schedule isnot "away" and $avery_mansion.schedule isnot "work" and ($avery_antiques.stolen.includes("dagger") or $avery_antiques.stolen.includes("amulet") or $avery_antiques.stolen.includes("mask"))>>
					<<set _event_display_2 to true>><<set _event_possible to true>>
				<</if>>
				<br>
			<<elseif $avery_mansion.display is 3>><<avery_housework_change "display" -1>>
				You polish the antiques in the display room.
				<<pass _housekeeping_time>>
				<<if $avery_antiques.progress is 0>>
					<<set _event_display to true>><<set _event_possible to true>>
				<<elseif $avery_mansion.schedule isnot "away" and $avery_mansion.schedule isnot "work" and ($avery_antiques.stolen.includes("dagger") or $avery_antiques.stolen.includes("amulet") or $avery_antiques.stolen.includes("mask"))>>
					<<set _event_display_2 to true>><<set _event_possible to true>>
				<</if>>
				<br>
			<<elseif $avery_mansion.display is 2>><<avery_housework_change "display" -1>>
				You rub down the antiques in the display room.
				<<pass _housekeeping_time>>
				<<if $avery_antiques.progress is 0>>
					<<set _event_display to true>><<set _event_possible to true>>
				<<elseif $avery_mansion.schedule isnot "away" and $avery_mansion.schedule isnot "work" and ($avery_antiques.stolen.includes("dagger") or $avery_antiques.stolen.includes("amulet") or $avery_antiques.stolen.includes("mask"))>>
					<<set _event_display_2 to true>><<set _event_possible to true>>
				<</if>>
				<br>
			<<elseif $avery_mansion.display is 1>><<avery_housework_change "display" -1>>
				You dust the antiques in the display room.
				<<pass _housekeeping_time>>
				<<if $avery_antiques.progress is 0>>
					<<set _event_display to true>><<set _event_possible to true>>
				<<elseif $avery_mansion.schedule isnot "away" and $avery_mansion.schedule isnot "work" and ($avery_antiques.stolen.includes("dagger") or $avery_antiques.stolen.includes("amulet") or $avery_antiques.stolen.includes("mask"))>>
					<<set _event_display_2 to true>><<set _event_possible to true>>
				<</if>>
				<br>
			<</if>>
		<</addinlineevent>>
	<</if>>
	
	<<if $avery_mansion.bedroom_state isnot "ignored" and $avery_mansion.bedroom_state isnot "locked">>
		<<if $avery_mansion.bedroom gte 1>>
			<<addinlineevent "avery_mansion_bedroom">>
				<<if $avery_mansion.bedroom gte 4>><<avery_housework_change "bedroom" -1>>
					You move the bed back to its proper place, and clean up the mess it was concealing.
					<<if $avery_mansion.schedule is "sleep">><<set _event_sleep to true>><</if>>
					<<pass _housekeeping_time>>
					<br>
				<<elseif $avery_mansion.bedroom gte 3>><<avery_housework_change "bedroom" -1>>
					You clean the suspicious smears in the bedroom.
					<<if $avery_mansion.schedule is "sleep">><<set _event_sleep to true>><</if>>
					<<pass _housekeeping_time>>
					<br>
				<<elseif $avery_mansion.bedroom gte 2>><<avery_housework_change "bedroom" -1>>
					You return the clothes in the bedroom to their homes.
					<<if $avery_mansion.schedule is "sleep">><<set _event_sleep to true>><</if>>
					<<pass _housekeeping_time>>
					<br>
				<<elseif $avery_mansion.bedroom gte 1>><<avery_housework_change "bedroom" -1>>
					You stretch out the sheets, and make the bed.
					<<if $avery_mansion.schedule is "sleep">><<set _event_sleep to true>><</if>>
					<<pass _housekeeping_time>>
					<br>
				<</if>>
			<</addinlineevent>>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>


	<<if $avery_mansion.bathroom gte 1>>
		<<addinlineevent "avery_mansion_bathroom">>
			<<if $avery_mansion.bathroom gte 4>><<avery_housework_change "bathroom" -1>>
				You clean the taps in the bathroom with a cloth.
				<<pass _housekeeping_time>>
				<br>
			<<elseif $avery_mansion.bathroom gte 3>><<avery_housework_change "bathroom" -1>>
				You soak the bath and sink in water and a chemical cleaner, restoring their pearly whiteness.
				<<pass _housekeeping_time>>
				<br>
			<<elseif $avery_mansion.bathroom gte 2>><<avery_housework_change "bathroom" -1>>
				You take the spiders in the bathroom outside.
				<<pass _housekeeping_time>>
				<br>
			<<elseif $avery_mansion.bathroom gte 1>><<avery_housework_change "bathroom" -1>>
				You dry the bathroom with a cloth.
				<<pass _housekeeping_time>>
				<br>
			<</if>>
		<</addinlineevent>>
	<</if>>

	<<if $avery_mansion.garden gte 1>>
		<<addinlineevent "avery_mansion_garden">>
			<<if $avery_mansion.garden gte 4>><<avery_housework_change "garden" -1>>
				You use a pair of shears to fight back the tangled weeds overrunning the garden.
				<<if $avery_mansion.schedule is "garden">><<set _event_garden to true>><<set _event_possible to true>><<set _event_possible to true>><</if>>
				<<pass _tending_time>>
				<br>
			<<elseif $avery_mansion.garden is 3>><<avery_housework_change "garden" -1>>
				Careful not to harm other flowers, you remove weeds from the garden.
				<<if $avery_mansion.schedule is "garden">><<set _event_garden to true>><<set _event_possible to true>><<set _event_possible to true>><</if>>
				<<pass _tending_time>>
				<br>
			<<elseif $avery_mansion.garden is 2>><<avery_housework_change "garden" -1>>
				You pull up the weeds in the garden by the root.
				<<if $avery_mansion.schedule is "garden">><<set _event_garden to true>><<set _event_possible to true>><<set _event_possible to true>><</if>>
				<<pass _tending_time>>
				<br>
			<<elseif $avery_mansion.garden is 1>><<avery_housework_change "garden" -1>>
				You prune the topiary to Avery's taste.
				<<if $avery_mansion.schedule is "garden">><<set _event_garden to true>><<set _event_possible to true>><<set _event_possible to true>><</if>>
				<<pass _tending_time>>
				<br>
			<</if>>
		<</addinlineevent>>
	<</if>>

	<<if $avery_mansion.pool gte 1>>
		<<addinlineevent "avery_mansion_pool">>
			<<if $avery_mansion.pool gte 4>><<avery_housework_change "pool" -1>>
				You unfurl a hose, and vacuum the pool clear of algae.
				<<if $avery_mansion.schedule is "pool">><<set _event_pool to true>><<set _event_possible to true>><</if>>
				<<pass _housekeeping_time>>
				<br>
			<<elseif $avery_mansion.pool is 3>><<avery_housework_change "pool" -1>>
				You retrieve chlorine from a nearby shed, and add a healthy dose to the pool.
				<<if $avery_mansion.schedule is "pool">><<set _event_pool to true>><<set _event_possible to true>><</if>>
				<<pass _housekeeping_time>>
				<br>
			<<elseif $avery_mansion.pool is 2>><<avery_housework_change "pool" -1>>
				You remove the bugs floating on the pool with a net.
				<<if $avery_mansion.schedule is "pool">><<set _event_pool to true>><<set _event_possible to true>><</if>>
				<<pass _housekeeping_time>>
				<br>
			<<elseif $avery_mansion.pool is 1>><<avery_housework_change "pool" -1>>
				You clear the bugs floating on the pool with a net, leaving it pristine.
				<<if $avery_mansion.schedule is "pool">><<set _event_pool to true>><<set _event_possible to true>><</if>>
				<<pass _housekeeping_time>>
				<br>
			<</if>>
		<</addinlineevent>>
	<</if>>
	<<runeventpool>>
<</for>>
<br>
<<cleareventpool>>
<<if _event_lounge is true>>
	<<addinlineevent "avery_event_lounge" 2>>
		<<set _event_triggered to true>>
		<<npc "Avery">><<person1>>
		Avery watches you while you work, going so far as to turn off the television. <<He>> props <<his>> elbow on the arm of the chair, and rests <<his>> head in <<his>> hand as <<he>> observes you.
		<br><br>

		<<link [[Tease|Mansion Housework Tease]]>><<exhibitionist1>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<link [[Ignore|Mansion Housework Ignore]]>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<link [[Be rude|Mansion Housework Rude]]>><<def 1>><<npcincr Avery love -1>><<npcincr Avery rage 1>><</link>><<llove>><<garage>>
	<br>
	<</addinlineevent>>
<</if>>

<<if _event_drink is true>>
	<<addinlineevent "avery_event_drink" 2>>
		<<set _event_triggered to true>>
		<<npc "Avery">><<person1>>
		"Sit," Avery says while you clean the lounge. <<He>> puts a second glass on the table, fills it with an expensive spirit, and pushes it your way.
		<br><br>
		<<link [[Drink (0:05)|Mansion Housework Drink]]>><<pass 5>><<set $drunk += 60>><<npcincr Avery love 1>><</link>><<galcohol>><<glove>>
		<br>
		<<link [[Refuse|Mansion Housework Drink Refuse]]>><<npcincr Avery love -1>><</link>><<llove>>
		<br>
	<</addinlineevent>>
<</if>>

<<if _event_dining is true>>
	<<addinlineevent "avery_event_dining" 2>>
		<<set _event_triggered to true>>
		<<npc "Avery">><<person1>>
		Avery eats breakfast as if you're not there, but you catch <<him>> watching you now and then, <<his>> gaze returning to <<his>> food so fast you might have imagined it.
		<br><br>
		"Fetch me cream from the kitchen," <<he>> says. "I fancy some with my dessert."
		<br><br>

		<<link [[Fetch cream (0:03)|Mansion Housework Cream]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<link [[Refuse|Mansion Housework Cream Refuse]]>><<npcincr Avery love -1>><<npcincr Avery rage 1>><</link>><<llove>><<garage>>
		<br>
	<</addinlineevent>>
<</if>>

<<if _event_sleep is true>>
	<<addinlineevent "avery_event_sleep" 2>>
		<<set _event_triggered to true>>
		<<npc "Avery">><<person1>>
		Avery tosses and turns while you work. <<His>> eyes snap open, and <<he>> observes you with a frown.
		<br><br>
		<<if $avery_mansion.bedroom_state is "ignored">>
			<<if C.npc.Avery.rage gte 20 and $averyragerevealed is 1>>
				"What the fuck did I tell you?" <<he>> says, turning on the bedside lamp and rising to <<his>> feet. "If you need a lesson so badly, so be it."<<garage>><<npcincr Avery rage 1>>
				<br><br>
				<<link [[Next|Mansion Housework Bedroom Rape]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>
				<br>
			<<else>>
				"I told you not to bother me while I slept," <<he>> growls. "Get the fuck out. Now."
				<br><br>
				<<link [[Comply|Mansion Housework Bedroom Comply]]>><<avery_housework_change "bedroom" 1>><<set $avery_mansion.bedroom_state to "locked">><</link>>
				<br>
				<<link [[Refuse|Mansion Housework Bedroom Refuse]]>><<npcincr Avery love -1>><<npcincr Avery rage 1>><</link>><<garage>><<llove>>
				<br>
			<</if>>
		<<else>>
			"Can't you do that in the morning?"
			<br><br>
			<<link [[Insist on cleaning now|Mansion Housework Bedroom Insist]]>><<npcincr Avery rage 1>><<npcincr Avery love -1>><</link>><<garage>><<llove>>
			<br>
			<<link [[Agree to clean later|Mansion Housework Bedroom Agree]]>><<avery_housework_change bedroom 1>><<set $avery_mansion.bedroom_state to "off-limits">><</link>>
			<br>
		<</if>>
	<</addinlineevent>>
<</if>>

<<if _event_garden is true>>
	<<addinlineevent "avery_event_garden" 2>>
		<<set _event_triggered to true>>
		<<npc "Avery">><<person1>>
		Avery potters in the garden, taking <<his>> time pruning individual leaves while you do the grunt work. "This one's exquisite," <<he>> says, gesturing at a holly bush. 
		<br><br>
		Avery makes delicate adjustments with <<his>> shears, stepping back to admire <<his>> handiwork often.
		<<if currentSkillValue('tending') gte 600>>
			<span class="green">You think you could do a better job.</span> It might be wise to keep it to yourself, however.
			<br><br>
			<<link [[Teach Avery|Mansion Housework Garden Teach]]>><</link>>
			<br>
		<<else>>
			<span class="red">Avery seems to know what <<hes>> doing.</span>
			<br><br>
		<</if>>
		<<link [[Compliment|Mansion Housework Garden Compliment]]>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<link [[Ignore|Mansion Housework Garden Ignore]]>><</link>>
		<br>
	<</addinlineevent>>
<</if>>

<<if _event_pool is true>>
	<<addinlineevent "avery_event_pool" 2>>
		<<npc "Avery">><<person1>>
		<<set _event_triggered to true>>
		Avery strides outside, <span class="lewd">wearing nothing.</span>
		<<if Weather.temperature <= 10>>
			The cold doesn't seem to bother <<him>>.
		<</if>>
		<<He>> pulls a pair of goggles over <<his>> eyes, and dives in, sending a rippling wave your way.
		<br><br>
		<<He>> emerges, and starts swimming lengths.
		<br><br>
		<<link [[Work around Avery without complaint|Mansion Housework Pool Work]]>><<stress 6>><</link>><<gstress>>
		<br>
		<<link [[Tell Avery to wait until you've finished|Mansion Housework Pool Tell]]>><<npcincr Avery rage 1>><</link>><<garage>>
		<br>
		<<link [[Stop cleaning for now|Mansion Pool]]>><<avery_housework_change "pool" 1>><</link>>
		<br>
	<</addinlineevent>>
<</if>>

<<if _event_display is true>>
	<<addinlineevent "avery_event_display" 2>>
		<<set _event_triggered to true>>
		<<set $avery_antiques.progress to 1>>
		Three objects in particular catch your eye in the display room, glittering in the light. A dagger, amulet, and mask, all made of gold. They look much more valuable than the other objects on display, and more worthy of a museum than here. They're kept behind thick glass. There's no lock, and the glass is sealed by metal bolts. Getting to them would be difficult.
		<br><br>

		<<link [[Work the bolts free|Mansion Housework Antiques]]>><<set $avery_antiques.bolt_progress += 1>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<link [[Ignore them|Mansion Housework Antiques Ignore]]>><</link>>
		<br>
	<</addinlineevent>>
<</if>>

<<if _event_display_2 is true>>
	<<addinlineevent "avery_event_display_2" 2>>
		<<npc "Avery">><<person1>>
		<<set _event_triggered to true>>
		Avery enters the display room, and inspects the antiques for dust.
		<<if $avery_antiques.stolen.includes("dagger") and $avery_antiques.stolen.includes("amulet") and $avery_antiques.stolen.includes("mask")>>
			<<set $avery_antiques.noticed.pushUnique("dagger")>>
			<<set $avery_antiques.noticed.pushUnique("amulet")>>
			<<set $avery_antiques.noticed.pushUnique("mask")>>
			<<set $avery_antiques.stolen.delete("dagger")>>
			<<set $avery_antiques.stolen.delete("amulet")>>
			<<set $avery_antiques.stolen.delete("mask")>>
			<<set $phase to 1>>
			<<He>> arrives at the display that once contained the dagger, amulet, and mask. <<He>> stares at it a moment.
			<br><br>
			"My antiques," <<he>> says, turning to you. "Where did you put them?"
			<br><br>
		<<elseif $avery_antiques.stolen.includes("dagger") and $avery_antiques.stolen.includes("amulet")>>
			<<set $avery_antiques.noticed.pushUnique("dagger")>>
			<<set $avery_antiques.noticed.pushUnique("amulet")>>
			<<set $avery_antiques.stolen.delete("dagger")>>
			<<set $avery_antiques.stolen.delete("amulet")>>
			<<set $phase to 1>>
			<<He>> arrives at the display that once housed the dagger and amulet. <<He>> stares at it a moment.
			<br><br>
			"My antiques," <<he>> says, turning to you. "Where did you put them?"
			<br><br>
		<<elseif $avery_antiques.stolen.includes("dagger") and $avery_antiques.stolen.includes("mask")>>
			<<set $avery_antiques.noticed.pushUnique("dagger")>>
			<<set $avery_antiques.noticed.pushUnique("mask")>>
			<<set $avery_antiques.stolen.delete("dagger")>>
			<<set $avery_antiques.stolen.delete("mask")>>
			<<set $phase to 1>>
			<<He>> arrives at the display that once housed the dagger and mask. <<He>> stares at it a moment.
			<br><br>
			"My antiques," <<he>> says, turning to you. "Where did you put them?"
			<br><br>
		<<elseif $avery_antiques.stolen.includes("amulet") and $avery_antiques.stolen.includes("mask")>>
			<<set $avery_antiques.noticed.pushUnique("amulet")>>
			<<set $avery_antiques.noticed.pushUnique("mask")>>
			<<set $avery_antiques.stolen.delete("amulet")>>
			<<set $avery_antiques.stolen.delete("mask")>>
			<<set $phase to 1>>
			<<He>> arrives at the display that once housed the amulet and mask. <<He>> stares at it a moment.
			<br><br>
			"My antiques," <<he>> says, turning to you. "Where did you put them?"
			<br><br>
		<<elseif $avery_antiques.stolen.includes("dagger")>>
			<<set $avery_antiques.noticed.pushUnique("dagger")>>
			<<set $avery_antiques.stolen.delete("dagger")>>
			<<He>> arrives at the display that once housed the dagger. <<He>> stares at it a moment.
			<br><br>
			"My antique," <<he>> says, turning to you. "Where did you put it?"
			<br><br>
		<<elseif $avery_antiques.stolen.includes("amulet")>>
			<<set $avery_antiques.noticed.pushUnique("amulet")>>
			<<set $avery_antiques.stolen.delete("amulet")>>
			<<He>> arrives at the display that once housed the amulet. <<He>> stares at it a moment.
			<br><br>
			"My antique," <<he>> says, turning to you. "Where did you put it?"
